==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|sh|sla-pro|*jebati}}, from {{der|sh|ine-pro|*h₃yebʰ-}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|οἴφω}}, {{cog|sa|यभति}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sh-IPA|jèbati}}
* {{hyphenation|sh|je|ba|ti}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=jèbati|a=impf}}

# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Jebali''' smo se c(ij)elo l(j)eto.|We were fucking the whole summer.}}
# {{lb|sh|reflexive|vulgar}} to have [[sexual]] [[relation]]s with someone
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Jebemo''' se kao zečevi kad god stignemo.|We fuck like rabbits whenever we can.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|Njih se dvoje '''jebe'''.|The two of them are fucking.}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar|figuratively}} to [[bother]], [[pest]], [[annoy]]
#: {{uxi|sh|Nemoj me '''jebati''' više!|Don't bother me anymore!|lit=Don't fuck me anymore!}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar|figuratively|negative}} not to [[pay attention]], not [[give a fuck]]
#: {{uxi|sh|Ja joj pričam, no ona me ne '''jebe'''!|I am talking to her but she doesn't give a fuck!|lit=I am talking to her but she doesn't fuck me!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|Ne '''jebe''' me uopće!|He/She doesn't give a fuck about me!|lit=He/She doesn't fuck me at all!}}
# {{non-gloss|figurative and idiomatic senses}}
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Jebi''' ga!|Fuck it!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|Neka se '''jebe'''.|He/She can go fuck himself/herself.|lit=He/she may fuck himself/herself.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|(T)ko te '''jebe'''!|Who gives a fuck about you!|lit=Who fucks you!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|Nitko te ne '''jebe'''!|Nobody gives a fuck about you!|lit=No one is fucking you!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|Možeš ga/se '''jebati'''...|There is nothing you can do...|lit=You can fuck it...}}
